  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Tamaki (laughing): “Yes. As you grow up, you draw lines. But when you were small, you received so much from your parents. In company terms, it’s a ‘merger.’ One wallet, one things. Joy and sorrow, together.”",
    "ja": "彼女の声は、緊張している。"
  },
